stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Submitted: User Submits Task & Workspace
    Submitted --> Planning: Invoking AI / Heuristic Planner
    Planning --> PlanValidation: Structured JSON Plan Returned
    PlanValidation --> PlanRejected: Invalid Schema / Bounded Retry Exceeded
    PlanValidation --> PlanReady: Schema Validated & Risk Tagged
    PlanRejected --> [*]

    PlanReady --> AutoExecuteRead: Autonomy = SAFE_AUTO & Only Read-Only Steps
    PlanReady --> AwaitingApproval: Plan Contains Modifications / Autonomy = REVIEW_ALL

    AwaitingApproval --> RejectedByUser: User Rejects Plan
    RejectedByUser --> [*]

    AwaitingApproval --> Executing: User Approves Action Tokens
    AutoExecuteRead --> Executing

    state Executing {
        [*] --> PreconditionCheck
        PreconditionCheck --> BackupSnapshot: Modifying Tool
        PreconditionCheck --> RunTool: Read-Only Tool
        BackupSnapshot --> RunTool
        RunTool --> DeterministicVerification
        DeterministicVerification --> [*]
    }

    Executing --> VerificationPassed: All Postconditions Match Hashes
    Executing --> PartialFailure: Step Failed / Verification Failed

    VerificationPassed --> ReceiptGenerated: Generate Proof-of-Work Receipt
    PartialFailure --> ReceiptGenerated: Record Unfinished / Failed Steps

    ReceiptGenerated --> OfferRoutine: Successful Workflow
    OfferRoutine --> RoutineSaved: User Saves "Routine DNA"
    OfferRoutine --> [*]
    RoutineSaved --> [*]
